 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Group Reporting – Plan Consolidation (28B)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this scope item, you can either collect the plan data from a file using the flexible upload feature of <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> or generate the plan data from the previous year's actual data. The user can then run a full consolidation process including currency translation, intercompany, and investments eliminations and reporting. The application includes several versions to enable reporting (Actual versus Plan, Plan, and Forecast).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Collect and validate data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Consolidate processes (conversions and eliminations)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get advanced reporting (comparative reports, forecasts)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the solution with actual consolidation to enable comparison of actual and plan reporting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Consolidate plan data from various sources (internal to <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> and external)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Store plan data in predefined versions</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>组报表 - 计划合并 (28B)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此范围项目，您可以使用 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 的灵活上载功能从文件收集计划数据，也可以从上一年的实际数据生成计划数据。然后，用户可以运行完整的合并流程，包括货币换算、公司间以及投资抵销和报告。该应用程序包含多个版本以启用报告（实际与计划、计划和预测）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">收集并验证数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">合并流程（转换和抵销）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取高级报表（比较报表、预测）</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofce28a476658499d90fda052a8f9e00a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将解决方案与实际合并集成，以便比较实际和计划报表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">合并来自不同来源（<span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 内部和外部）的计划数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在预定义版本中存储计划数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
